{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村真夏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり違和感ないヽ(｡･∀･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーの名字と\n合体させてみました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと時間がないので\n短くなっちゃうけど...\n少しだけ更新させてください∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都で全国握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都・名古屋での全握が復活して\n嬉しい〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手会だけではなく、\nミニライブも開催されます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルで曲を披露する機会は\nすごく少ないからミニライブは\n私たちにとっても大事なライブ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日来てくださるみなさん！\nガンガン盛り上がっちゃって\nくださーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さなステージだけれど、\nああやって初期からずっと続いてる\nミニライブのみなさんとの\n一体感やあたたかい空気感\nすっごく大好きですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はなぜか頻繁にじゅんなと\nちーちゃんを見間違います。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ちーちゃんかと思った！と\n私がじゅんなに言うと、\nまーた真夏さん同じこと言ってるよ\nっていつも怒られます(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜の時期の京都に行きた過ぎて\n京都の旅行雑誌はたくさん\n持ってるのに昨日コンビニで\n京都の桜特集の雑誌を見つけちゃって\n気づいたら買ってました(OωO )♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都と沖縄は昔から特に好きで\n旅行社のパンフレットとかも\nよくもらってくるよ〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また近いうちに一人旅したいな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん・まいやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の全握ペアは\nろってぃーとです(b・ω・d)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度か握手会やイベントでも\nペアになったことがあるから\nお久しぶりさんもいるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーのファンの方は\nろってぃーと似て優しくて\nほんわかしていていつも\n私の方が楽しませて\nいただいちゃってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衝撃的に歌が下手な秋元と\n衝撃的に歌が上手な川村。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなコンビですが\nちょこっとでも気になったら\nぎゅーしに来てくれると\n嬉しいですっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー推しさんも\nまなったん推したんも\nたくさんキュンキュン\nしてってね♡chu♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第5レーンにて待ってまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！真夏の手の香りも\n楽しみにしててね(。-ω-)｡°｡°｡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうもないこと聞いていいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よく思うんだけど、\n新幹線に長く乗って移動するとき\nお尻が痛くなりません？(*´･ω･`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら痛くならずに\n乗れるんだろう...(´-ω-`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしオススメの座り方あったら\n教えてくださーい(*´･ｖ･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのご飯中の顔♡笑\n唇がセクシー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はまた若月とカフェ行って\nおしゃべりして来た(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相当頻繁にご飯やお茶してる\n気がするなぁ〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも考えが似たところが\n多いからよく乃木坂について\n話し合ったりもします(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大半がくだらないことだけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次も甘いもの食べに行く予定♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいだろぉ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあすごくコンパクトな\nブログで申し訳ないですが\n今日はこの辺で(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/03/20/5901447/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひみこさま〜！"}],"source":"archive"}